// tiles across - 3313 to 3318, z 3160 to 3165, everything north of 3165 blocked - so the south
// face is the ONLY side they can ever stand on, and that is the side the reach test refuses:
// "I can't reach that!". The swing itself is fine and fires from the east, west and north.
//
// Measured, not guessed, and all three of these changed nothing, so none of them is here:
// forceapproach=south, length 1 instead of the cache's 2, and blockwalk=no.
